{
  "what": "Hand-keyed second capex lines that carry no us-gaap tag, to be ADDED to the tagged capex line (cashFlow.capex) for the same span by the capex-panel builder (PR H2). Values in USD as filed (the filings print thousands). A span is the filing's own year-to-date column; a quarter is the span less the earlier spans of the fiscal year, the rule statements.mjs applies to the tagged line. Every row names the filing by accession and the R page the figure was read from; the figures and their sums are those of the capex-ledger refutation (the capex ledger's refutation block, corrections 1-8; the ledger lands in frontend/data/ledgers/ in PR H3), which reads: IREN FY2025 quarters 383.4 / 187.6 / 443.9 / 357.9 = 1,372.6 and FY2026 280.6 / 719.1 / 1,355.3 / 1,978.1 = 4,333.1 (tagged 2,998.0 + hardware 1,335.1); CIFR 2024 302.5 (139.5 + 163.0) with quarters 12.4 / 39.1 / 176.1 / 74.8, and 2025 492.8 (487.9 + 4.9) with Q3 44.7 and Q4 229.8.",
